eries each time appearing  slightly different the new 52 when DC  rebooted the Suicide Squad comics as  part of its new 52 event hardly got a  major style overhaul introducing her red  and blue pigtails corset hot pants and  heel  the series also revamped our origin  story to include the chemical skin  alterations later seen in the cinematic  version soon after that first  stand-alone series got its own reboot  and ushered in the era of blue and pink  eye shadow although the colors of her  costume and hair hearken back to her  signature red and black fur midriff legs  and more were still on full display  Suicide Squad the cinematic Suicide  Squad followed suit and displaying  Hartley's allure on-screen in the flick  Margot Robbie's Harley also sported  pigtails partially dyed blue and pink  tiny shorts at a dirty shirt red varsity  jacket a ton of tattoos and boots while  the getup paid tribute to the past  versions of the character it also  arrived as its own new spin Bruce Timm  Harley's original designer told Gizmodo  that the characters new design looked  quote really cool Dini  meanwhile thought the daddy's monster  approach was a good way to make it work  I know it's jarring for a lot of the  people who loved the the classic Bruce  Timm suit I love it myself I mean it but  in that work fold I just don't see it  happening the changes have since been  incorporated into DC's rebirth  initiative launched in the summer of  2016 this new Harley Quinn has the  screen versions hair style makeup and a  much more urbanized garment game who  keeping up with all those style changes  can be well vexing I'm known to be quite  vexing I'm just forewarning you thanks  for watching subscribe to our YouTube  channel to watch more videos like the  one you just saw and leave us a comment  to let us know which is your favorite  Harley Quinn costume
 

